
# CIMCMS LED Controller Tests

Recommended test order:

1. I2C scanner
2. PCF8574 keypad
3. OLED
4. DS3231 RTC
5. WS2812
6. Relay driver
7. Full firmware integration

Keep mains-connected loads disconnected during testing.

Test each relay channel individually.
Relay 1 and Relay 3 remain disabled until
the replacement relay module is validated.
